    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/d011fcc881494c0e14ff93a00ec54c86.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witch City Stories</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world ruled by ordinary men, magic is a gift possessed by only a few. <strong>Pipi, a young and inexperienced witch, is destined to face a cataclysm of planetary proportions</strong>, she must get rid of a meteorite and save all the beings that inhabit the planet. To do so, she must <strong>discover the right spell and gather the necessary elements</strong> to perform it. <strong>Will Pipi be able to save them all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/2b193d52942158592d94bc3551d82978.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/d1a2d6d541b0f6cce237828b7dc44b50.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Loop. Master the Magic. Change Fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>2D visual novel</strong> set in an industrialized society of the 1980s, where magic exists but only a few can wield it. In this world of neon lights and dark secrets, you will play as <strong>Pipi, a witch descendant of the Mongoose clan</strong>, on a mission that defies fate: <strong>breaking the time loop that dooms humanity to relive the same cataclysm every five days</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>crucial choices, uncertain alliances, and magical duels</strong> as you uncover the truth behind the families that control the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you balance the scales of power or be lost in the web of conspiracies?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vibrant and mysterious city</strong>, full of details where magic and technology collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the time loop</strong> and find the key to breaking it before the world resets again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master magic</strong> to interact with the environment, solve puzzles, and engage in witchcraft duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your destiny</strong> by making choices that shape the story and lead to multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Serpent clan</strong>, a family willing to do anything to seize power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover unexpected twists, hidden secrets, and the true cost of magic.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/5ef6abb2ffd79a8cac42e8a29673cae4.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/a53e4c963ee8d97211a8b9f4a45e4805.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=170 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/d011fcc881494c0e14ff93a00ec54c86.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witch City Stories</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world ruled by ordinary men, magic is a gift possessed by only a few. <strong>Pipi, a young and inexperienced witch, is destined to face a cataclysm of planetary proportions</strong>, she must get rid of a meteorite and save all the beings that inhabit the planet. To do so, she must <strong>discover the right spell and gather the necessary elements</strong> to perform it. <strong>Will Pipi be able to save them all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/2b193d52942158592d94bc3551d82978.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/d1a2d6d541b0f6cce237828b7dc44b50.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Loop. Master the Magic. Change Fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>2D visual novel</strong> set in an industrialized society of the 1980s, where magic exists but only a few can wield it. In this world of neon lights and dark secrets, you will play as <strong>Pipi, a witch descendant of the Mongoose clan</strong>, on a mission that defies fate: <strong>breaking the time loop that dooms humanity to relive the same cataclysm every five days</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>crucial choices, uncertain alliances, and magical duels</strong> as you uncover the truth behind the families that control the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you balance the scales of power or be lost in the web of conspiracies?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vibrant and mysterious city</strong>, full of details where magic and technology collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the time loop</strong> and find the key to breaking it before the world resets again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master magic</strong> to interact with the environment, solve puzzles, and engage in witchcraft duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your destiny</strong> by making choices that shape the story and lead to multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Serpent clan</strong>, a family willing to do anything to seize power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover unexpected twists, hidden secrets, and the true cost of magic.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/5ef6abb2ffd79a8cac42e8a29673cae4.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544570/extras/a53e4c963ee8d97211a8b9f4a45e4805.avif?t=1741898084\" data-has-big width=800 height=170 /></span></p>",
